# The through port goes dark when t1 = t2 a: the input coupler must make up for the loss and the drop coupler together.

title Add-drop ring at critical coupling
medium lambda0=1.55 neff=2.4 ng=4.2 loss_db_cm=4
sweep 1.545 1.555 16001

comp c1 coupler kappa=0.05548179919
comp c2 coupler kappa=0.05
comp w1 waveguide length=31.4159265359
comp w2 waveguide length=31.4159265359
link c1.4 w1.1
link w1.2 c2.4
link c2.2 w2.1
link w2.2 c1.2
port in c1.1
port through c1.3
port drop c2.1
port add c2.3

expect passive
expect deeper through -30
